# Spider dataset — ~100 MB of sqlite files, never commit
data/*
!data/README.md

# cached LLM responses (regenerable, and can contain API output)
.llm_cache/

# Per-question run records ARE committed: they are the evidence behind every
# number in results.md, and they are what the error analysis is done on.
# A full dev run is ~700 KB.

# secrets
.env

